<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-002" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-002-chendaozhi-zhuizun" source-id="s-nanqishu-002-chendaozhi-zhuizun-ws2312009">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-002-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">五月丙午</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-002-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">追封謚上兄<persName id="c-nanqishu-002-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p002:m0005" ref="egx_xax_4ic_A">道度</persName>為衡陽元王，<persName id="c-nanqishu-002-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p002:m0013" ref="98q_mll_d6v">道生</persName>為始安貞王。丙寅，追尊皇考曰<persName id="c-nanqishu-002-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p002:m0029" ref="egx_xax_4ic">宣皇帝</persName>，皇妣為<persName id="c-nanqishu-002-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p002:m0036" ref="pib_5me_1wm_A">孝皇后</persName>，妃為<persName id="c-nanqishu-002-chendaozhi-zhuizun:p002:m0042" ref="gm4_alk_hn7_AA">昭皇后</persName>。</p>
</text>
